flowchart TD
    A[Explicit URL or option or compiled default] --> B[Optional digest appended to URL path]
    B --> C[CopyTrustObject GET request]
    C --> D[HTTP message and headers]
    D --> E[Transport options and pre-action callback]
    E --> F[AMSupportHttpSendSync backend]
    F --> G[Authentication callback and mutable response outputs]
    G --> H[Outer status gate: 200 or 202]
    H --> I[Non-null returned data object]
    I --> J[Higher-level digest and ticket policy: Stage 6C]
